  slug: 'human-capital-social-development-officer-mock-exam-4',
  title: 'Human Capital & Social Development Officer — Mock Exam 4',
  summary: 'Practice Rwanda’s decentralisation structure and local governance, District-level planning and performance reporting, and the psychometric reasoning domains (critical thinking, problem solving, communication, coordination, adaptability) explicitly listed for this post.',
  free: false,
